          "value": 5,
          "version": 1
        },
        "parameters_version": 2
      },
      "comments": "Recover identity in the original 500-column acquisition using row=floor(local/32) and column=local-row*32. This formula assumes the documented first 32 rows / first 32 columns crop.",
